Package: risk.decision
Title: Decision Quality Tools for Risk Assessment
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Cory", "Whitney", email = "CWWhitney@users.noreply.github.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Calculates expected values, risk measures, loss exceedance curves
    and the value of information from probabilities and outcomes. Draws risk
    matrices shaded by expected loss and risk maps with ggplot2.
